  "gradeRuleDescribe": {
    "yms_year": 114.0,
    "yms_smester": 1.0,
    "cls_id": "CI02310",
    "sub_id": "65196",
    "scr_dup": "001",
    "tpa_score_new": "<div>1. Middle Exam (Open Books) - 20% 2. Final Exam (Open Books) - 20% 3. Assignments+Programming - 50% 4. Final Presentation - 20%</div>\n",
    "tpa_score_new_en": " ",
    "course_pol": "1. 學生上課不得隨意遲到、早退, 或以莫名之理由請假、曠缺課\n2. 上課期間學生得認真參與學習, 避免非必要之手機上網與交談\n3. 網路上請益與問題互動, 需注意基本網路社交禮儀",
    "course_pol_en": "1. Students are not allowed to be late for class, leave early, or ask for leave or be absent from class for inexplicable reasons.\n2. Students must participate seriously in learning during class and avoid unnecessary surfing the Internet and talking on mobile phones.\n3. When interacting with friends and questions online, you need to pay attention to basic online social etiquette.",
    "course_rem": null,
    "course_rem_en": null,
    "ais_meno": "<div>1. 學生作業需親力親為;&nbsp;若抄襲它人作業者, 經查證, 該作業將採分數均分計算</div>\n\n<div>2. 學生考試需謹遵考場規定, 不得作弊等不法行為.&nbsp;一旦發生, 將以零分計算.</div>\n\n<div>3. 學生作業參考網路與ChatGPT相關生成範本時, 不可全數抄襲, 但需明確標明出處與方法</div>\n",
    "ais_meno_en": "<div>1. Students must do their own homework; if a student plagiarizes other people&rsquo;s homework, after verification, the homework will be divided into points.<br />\n2. Students must strictly abide by the regulations of the examination room and are not allowed to cheat or other illegal activities. Once this occurs, a score of zero will be calculated.<br />\n3. When students use the Internet and ChatGPT to generate templates for their homework, they are not allowed to plagiarize in full, but the source and method must be clearly marked.</div>\n",
    "ilearn_mk": null
  },
